sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as Control/Temporal
  participant P as OPA
  participant R as GitHub Runner
  participant A as Claude Code or Droid
  participant G as GitHub
  participant V as Codex/Human Reviewer
  U->>C: request coding task
  C->>P: authorize task/resources
  P-->>C: allow + limits + approval
  U->>C: explicit approval
  C->>R: dispatch one-writer manifest
  R->>A: scoped LiteLLM/MCP credentials
  A->>R: code/tests in task branch
  R->>G: push branch + PR
  G->>V: independent review/CI
  V-->>G: approve or request changes
  Note over G: human-only merge
